  "provenance": "Repo-local descriptor (the publisher's own repo). Backends and context come from the repo's litertlm_manifest.json. A hybrid Mamba-2 / attention reasoning model: the bundle declares the thought channel and its generation prompt opens it (<think> then a newline), so the model reasons from its first token; with thinking off the template closes the block at once (<think></think>). handler_config.channels spells the same channel and thinking_default is true. The manifest lists cpu and gpu with cpu as the default: on one Galaxy S26 the GPU path crashed while the OpenCL delegate initialized its kernels (litert_lm_advanced_main v0.16.0, 2026-09-05, the manifest's known_issues), so the default profile is cpu and the gpu profile loads only when asked for.",
